load @term/seed/group/homomorphism
  find group-homomorphism

# A group isomorphism: a bijective homomorphism, both injective and surjective, so the two groups are the same up to
# renaming. The twenty-four unit Hurwitz quaternions are isomorphic to the binary tetrahedral group. The form carries
# the underlying homomorphism; bijectivity is the added condition.
form group-isomorphism
  link map, like group-homomorphism
